{"ID":"20230928085454-isa93fv","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230928085454-isa93fv","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085454-isa93fv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085457-rggow7u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085512-wcd6dqu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085457-rggow7u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"百会穴","type":"doc","updated":"20230928085517"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230928085457-rggow7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085457-rggow7u","updated":"20230928085457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"百会穴，诸阳之会（所有的阳经都会在头上），百病皆治；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085500-l9usq9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085500-l9usq9m"}},{"ID":"20230928085457-ejvifpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085457-ejvifpk","updated":"20230928085457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人体有六条阳经，手有三阳，足有三阳；阴经只到脖子，阴经没有上头的，只有阳经会上头；所以古代说‘斩下六阳魁首’，六阳魁首就是头部；头部是没有阴经的。"}]},{"ID":"20230928085457-h9ie52s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085457-h9ie52s","updated":"20230928085457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以天气再怎么冷，头都是在外面的，因为没有阴经，六条阳经都经过这个地方；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085500-nj403mp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085500-nj403mp"}},{"ID":"20230928085457-i2ooq30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085457-i2ooq30","updated":"20230928085457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 刺百会穴，在百会穴前五分的地方，斜刺入百会； 扎头针，是在头皮跟头骨之间刺入，不是直接直扎进去的；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085501-y8u2c2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085501-y8u2c2b"}},{"ID":"20230928085511-6hwzus7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085511-6hwzus7","updated":"20230928085511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20230928085511-6tkoidg.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928085512-4x6smut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085512-4x6smut"}},{"ID":"20230928085512-wcd6dqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085512-wcd6dqu","updated":"20230928085517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"放血时，则把百会穴的皮肤刺破，让他血流出来；"}]}]}